{"speciesId":385,"names":{"fr":"Jirachi","es":"Jirachi","en":"Jirachi","ja":"ジラーチ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"A legend states that JIRACHI will make true any wish that is written on notes attached to its head when it awakens. If this POKéMON senses danger, it will fight without awakening."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"JIRACHI will awaken from its sleep of a thousand years if you sing to it in a voice of purity. It is said to make true any wish that people desire."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"JIRACHI is said to make wishes come true. While it sleeps, a tough crystalline shell envelops the body to protect it from enemies."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It is said to make any wish come true. It is awake for only seven days out of a thousand years."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It is said to make any wish come true. It is awake for only seven days out of a thousand years."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It is said to have the ability to grant any wish for just one week every thousand years."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It is said to have the ability to grant any wish for just one week every thousand years."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It is said to have the ability to grant any wish for just one week every thousand years."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Generations have believed that any wish written on a note on its head will come true when it awakens."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Generations have believed that any wish written on a note on its head will come true when it awakens."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"On raconte qu’une fois tous les mille ans, il a la capacité d’exaucer tous les vœux durant une semaine."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It is said to have the ability to grant any wish for just one week every thousand years."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"On raconte qu’une fois tous les mille ans, il a la capacité d’exaucer tous les vœux durant une semaine."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It is said to have the ability to grant any wish for just one week every thousand years."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It is said to have the ability to grant any wish for just one week every thousand years."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It is said to have the ability to grant any wish for just one week every thousand years."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"On raconte qu’à son réveil, il exauce les vœux écrits sur les rubans de papier de sa tête."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Desde antaño se dice que concederá los deseos escritos en las notas de su cabeza cuando se despierte."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Generations have believed that any wish written on a note on its head will come true when it awakens."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"目覚めた とき 頭の 短冊に 書かれた 願い事を かなえると 大昔から 語り継がれてきた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"On raconte qu’une fois tous les 1 000 ans, il a la capacité d’exaucer tous les vœux durant une semaine."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Se dice que puede otorgar cualquier deseo durante una semana cada 1000 años."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It is said to have the ability to grant any wish for just one week every thousand years."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"１０００年間で ７日だけ 目を 覚まし どんな 願い事でも かなえる 力を 使うという。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Une légende raconte qu’à son réveil, Jirachi réalise n’importe quel souhait inscrit sur les papiers collés sur sa tête. Si ce Pokémon se sent en danger, il se défend sans même se réveiller."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Cuenta la leyenda que Jirachi hará realidad cualquier deseo que se le escriba en las notas que lleva en la cabeza cuando las lea tras salir de su letargo. Si este Pokémon siente peligro, luchará sin haber llegado a despertarse."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"A legend states that Jirachi will make true any wish that is written on notes attached to its head when it awakens. If this Pokémon senses danger, it will fight without awakening."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"目覚めた とき 頭の 短冊に 書かれた 願いを かなえると いう 伝説を もつ。 危険を 感じると 眠ったまま 戦う。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Jirachi dort depuis mille ans, mais il se réveillera si on lui chante quelque chose avec une voix d’une grande pureté. On raconte qu’il peut exaucer les vœux des gens."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Jirachi despertará de su letargo de miles de años si se le canta con una voz pura. Dicen que este Pokémon hace realidad cualquier deseo que se tenga."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Jirachi will awaken from its sleep of a thousand years if you sing to it in a voice of purity. It is said to make true any wish that people desire."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"清らかな 声で 歌を 聞かせて あげると １０００年の 眠りから 目を 覚ます。 人の 願いを なんでも かなえると いう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Une fois tous les mille ans, le chant d’une voix pure le tire de son sommeil pour sept jours seulement."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"El son de un canto puro y cristalino puede despertarlo de su sueño durante siete días una vez cada mil años."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Once every 1,000 years, the singing of a pure voice will rouse this Pokémon from its near- perpetual slumber. It wakes for only seven days."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"１０００年に 一度 清らかな 歌声を 聞くことで ７日の あいだ だけ 目を 覚ます。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"On raconte que lorsqu’il se réveille de son sommeil millénaire, il exauce les vœux écrits sur les rubans de papier de sa tête."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Se dice que concederá los deseos escritos en las notas de su cabeza cuando se despierte de su sueño milenario."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It’s believed that when this Pokémon wakes from its 1,000-year slumber, it will grant any wishes written on the notes attached to its head."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"１０００年の 眠りから 目覚めた とき 頭の 短冊に 書かれた 願い事を かなえる という。"}],"varieties":[{"id":385,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"mega-kick","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[10,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[5,"level-up",35],[6,"level-up",35],[6,"tutor",0],[7,"level-up",35],[7,"tutor",0],[8,"level-up",40],[9,"level-up",40],[10,"level-up",40],[11,"level-up",40],[12,"level-up",35],[13,"level-up",35],[13,"tutor",0],[14,"level-up",40],[15,"level-up",40],[16,"level-up",40],[17,"level-up",40],[18,"level-up",40],[20,"level-up",77],[23,"level-up",77],[25,"level-up",77],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"psybeam","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"machine",0],[13,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunderbolt","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"machine",0],